Job Description
Vertex Technologies, a global supplier of software engineering and IT outsourcing services, is looking for a Middle&nbsp;C++ Developer in its office in Egypt. You’ll be part of a team of professionals who develop software in various fields like video processing, 3D graphics, embedded systems, etc.
RESPONSIBILITIES:
Developing programs in fields of&nbsp;video processing, 3D graphics, embedded systems, etc.
WHAT WE OFFER:
Long-term career stability with a competitive salary paid in USD.
Conditions for steady career development.
Development supported by dedicated mentors and a variety of programs focused on expertise and innovation.
