2 : 3 years of experience in IT role.&nbsp;
Good knowledge of MCSA or CCNA.&nbsp;
Experience in SAP system “Account management”.&nbsp;
Flexible and multi-tasker.&nbsp;
Professional English speaker.&nbsp;
Has good knowledge in programming languages like html, CSS, python is a plus.

